---
name: Authentication & RBAC System
description: 3-role system (admin, magasinier, chef_chantier) with RLS-backed permissions
type: feature
---
## Roles
- **admin**: Full access, user management, delete discharges/products
- **magasinier**: Stock operations, create/edit discharges, manage articles, returns
- **chef_chantier**: View own discharges, request materials, limited access

## Implementation
- app_role enum: admin | magasinier | chef_chantier (was admin | worker)
- `has_any_role()` function for multi-role checks
- `usePermissions` hook provides boolean flags for all actions
- RLS policies enforce backend security per role
- Header nav items hidden based on role
- profiles table has `assigned_project` column for future project filtering
